<title>USA: BeautiControl sees FY96 eps above estimates.</title>
<headline>BeautiControl sees FY96 eps above estimates.</headline>
<dateline>DALLAS 1996-12-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>BeautiControl Cosmetics Inc said on Monday it expected its fiscal year 1996 earnings to exceed analysts' expectations by as much as 10 percent.</p>
<p>The First Call consensus estimate for the fiscal year was $0.80 per share compared to $0.77 per share last fiscal year.</p>
<p>BeautiControl, which said it plans to release its earnings in January, attributed the strong results to continued growth and new product introductions like Color Freeze lip color and its SlenderGenics weight control products.</p>
</text>
